# ACE OS package selection.
# Kept deliberately lean: the target machine has 4 GB RAM and 128 GB eMMC.
# Every name here is verified against the archive before the ISO is built.

## Desktop (XFCE — light enough for 4 GB RAM)
task-xfce-desktop
task-laptop
lightdm
xfce4-power-manager
xfce4-screenshooter
xfce4-taskmanager
mousepad
ristretto
xarchiver
thunar-archive-plugin

## Installer (graphical, beginner-friendly)
calamares
calamares-settings-debian

## Dark look + modern type
greybird-gtk-theme
papirus-icon-theme
fonts-jetbrains-mono
fonts-inter
fonts-firacode
fonts-noto-color-emoji

## Live wallpaper, RGB ring, screensavers
python3-gi
python3-gi-cairo
gir1.2-gtk-3.0
xscreensaver
xscreensaver-data

## Everyday apps
firefox-esr
vlc
gnome-disk-utility
gparted

